{"id":"v3","level":4,"levelName":"The verb system","n":4,"of":10,"title":"Making it happen","titleHe":"בִּנְיַן הִפְעִיל","goal":"Recognise hif'il and its causative sense.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"הִפְעִיל usually means causing the action rather than doing it. Its present begins with מַ and has a long i in the middle; its past begins with הִ."},{"type":"binyan","he":"הִפְעִיל","en":"hif'il","note":"Causative — making someone else do or become something.","verb":{"root":"ס־ב־ר","inf":"לְהַסְבִּיר","en":"to explain"},"tense":"present","rows":[{"label":"masculine singular","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּיר"},{"label":"feminine singular","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירָה"},{"label":"masculine plural","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירִים"},{"label":"feminine plural","he":"","form":"מַסְבִּירוֹת"}]},{"type":"binyan","he":"הִפְעִיל","en":"hif'il","note":"Causative — making someone else do or become something.","verb":{"root":"ס־ב־ר","inf":"לְהַסְבִּיר","en":"to explain"},"tense":"past","rows":[{"label":"I","he":"אֲנִי","form":"הִסְבַּרְתִּי"},{"label":"you (m.)","he":"אַתָּה","form":"הִסְבַּרְתָּ"},{"label":"you (f.)","he":"אַתְּ","form":"הִסְבַּרְתְּ"},{"label":"he","he":"הוּא","form":"הִסְבִּיר"},{"label":"she","he":"הִיא","form":"הִסְבִּירָה"},{"label":"we","he":"אֲנַחְנוּ","form":"הִסְבַּרְנוּ"},{"label":"you (m.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּם","form":"הִסְבַּרְתֶּם"},{"label":"you (f.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּן","form":"הִסְבַּרְתֶּן"},{"label":"they","he":"הֵם / הֵן","form":"הִסְבִּירוּ"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"The causative link is often visible across binyanim on one root. From ל־ב־ש: לוֹבֵשׁ wears, מַלְבִּישׁ dresses someone else, מִתְלַבֵּשׁ gets dressed."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מַסְבִּיר","en":"explains","translit":"masbir"},{"he":"מַתְחִיל","en":"begins","translit":"matchil"},{"he":"מַרְגִּישׁ","en":"feels","translit":"margish"},{"he":"מַזְמִין","en":"invites, orders","translit":"mazmin"},{"he":"מַכִּיר","en":"knows, is acquainted with","translit":"makir"},{"he":"מַחְלִיט","en":"decides","translit":"machlit"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["come! (m.)","what (Aramaic)","explains","brown"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מַסְבִּיר","translit":"masbir"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["asks for","door","begins","always"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מַתְחִיל","translit":"matchil"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["un-, without","feels","living room","and he saw"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מַרְגִּישׁ","translit":"margish"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["invites, orders","moon","medicine","part, portion"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מַזְמִין","translit":"mazmin"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["knowledge","knows, is acquainted with","lives, resides","nothing"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מַכִּיר","translit":"makir"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["old man, elder","half","form, shape","decides"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מַחְלִיט","translit":"machlit"},{"type":"choice","q":"Which binyan is this verb in?","options":["הִפְעִיל","נִפְעַל","פִּעֵל","פָּעַל"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מְדַבֵּר"},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מַסְבִּיר","explains"],["מַתְחִיל","begins"],["מַרְגִּישׁ","feels"],["מַזְמִין","invites, orders"],["מַכִּיר","knows, is acquainted with"]]},{"type":"read","he":"מַזְמִין","translit":"mazmin","en":"invites, orders"},{"type":"choice","q":"explain — feminine singular, present","options":["מַסְבִּירִים","מַסְבִּירָה","מַסְבִּיר","מַסְבִּירוֹת"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"הִפְעִיל, present: feminine singular is מַסְבִּירָה."},{"type":"choice","q":"explain — masculine plural, present","options":["מַסְבִּיר","מַסְבִּירוֹת","מַסְבִּירִים","מַסְבִּירָה"],"correct":2,"he":true,"why":"הִפְעִיל, present: masculine plural is מַסְבִּירִים."},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["מַזְמִין","מַכִּיר","מַתְחִיל","מַרְגִּישׁ"],"correct":0,"say":"מַזְמִין","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"explain — masculine singular, present","opt